            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kelly P"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Wonderful cake! I also used 1 cup of strong brewed coffee instead of the water. I increased the chocolate to 6 ounces. Very moist and delicious. I used a bundt pan and the baking time for my cake was about 40 minutes. Will definitely be making this alot!",
            "datePublished": "2008-10-13T07:07:02.023Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
